params.description:
Adds a field called `usable_in_accounts` which is an object describing the accounts where the dataset can be used for targeting.
```
"usable_in_accounts": [
  {
      "name": "a-b6206def",
      "instance": "p",
      "domain": "fifthlevelfashion.com"
  },
  {
      "name": "a-b6206def",
      "instance": "p",
      "domain": "fifthlevelfashion.us"
  }
]
```
